msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh la la, mais tu as une de ces têtes, mon pauvre Mell !"

#: scenario:scenario_5F7BF063_7788_4257_835D_D2C3D737A70A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
