msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F2B800A9_E9C2_4FDB_BF00_BA9CE841C619"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the ladies of the house all had abigails, so there were several women servants, "
"myself included."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cependant, les dames de la maison avaient toutes des soubrettes à leur service, donc il y "
"avait plusieurs femmes, moi y compris."

#: scenario:scenario_3EFDABD3_7A5E_425F_9145_E98B388782F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c6221bd50719b22bb112eaa26bd1587c6c2ea18710a8374f8221f0c1dd8be31
#. default-sha256: 949167722ab018e4120bcc2901686f9d421504adf6552c4722ec704494619d66
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3EFDABD3_7A5E_425F_9145_E98B388782F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maids, by and large, were selected from the daughters of other esteemed families."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les servantes, pour la plupart, étaient choisies parmi les filles d’autres familles nobles."

#: scenario:scenario_FA6A950A_915A_4A16_9051_F376D8BE7F12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a560760f547afed7dc1b912781e351a687bf8ddadbe45913d760b9e92e9c5fb9
