msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FA6A950A_915A_4A16_9051_F376D8BE7F12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was, you could say, a sort of training before they entered society. ⟪k:1⟫The girls would "
"serve at houses even more powerful than their own."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était, pourrait-on dire, une sorte d’entraînement avant d’entrer en société. ⟪k:1⟫Les "
"filles servaient dans des maisons plus puissantes que la leur."

#: scenario:scenario_FA6A950A_915A_4A16_9051_F376D8BE7F22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a87c6ca797d13e3f8b2a7d59baae6ab38f1130e4dc612362cbe5de538383f03
