msgid "⟪k:0⟫When he heard this, Mell could not sit still any longer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ cette nouvelle, Mell ne tint plus en place."

#: scenario:scenario_E7159022_74E4_4DFA_A8B6_0C17FE1FAAA4
