msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, ⟪k:2⟫uh, ⟪k:3⟫I didn’t really think this through, did I?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I don’t even know "
"where she is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, ⟪k:2⟫euh, ⟪k:3⟫eh bien on ne peut pas dire que je m’y prenne comme il faut...⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Je ne sais même pas où elle se trouve."

#: scenario:scenario_75891131_002A_4F72_AA5A_6105623451E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ae313398f3ffce98a70324312d4776b59447f762b149193a907a4fdf411c20b
