#: scenario:scenario_C7F5FC13_B625_44CA_8578_533EFFADC3C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9990fab7e033143f9a2fc0b15bbb19e3b26cc4a3456ae709f30e92909453dc38
#. default-sha256: 866543c6aa999a8e39869e5b2169bb8b8f6736b58516905458d1ca48759641cd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C7F5FC13_B625_44CA_8578_533EFFADC3C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Deep down, he was having difficulty believing the young woman he had seen the previous night "
"was truly here to be a servant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au fond de lui, il avait du mal à croire que la jeune femme qu’il avait vue la nuit "
"précédente était vraiment là pour être une servante."

#: scenario:scenario_64F00BBE_7B8D_46C5_B568_8BD153322816
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ffacc0dce67b99b6d4c6616e7ce8314678b4209cc0b0314b2aa97220df23fef0
#. default-sha256: c0cc7dbaf29eb903e1959c7030f1151d005fb3490ee255d962e0d7a519a9a7b5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_64F00BBE_7B8D_46C5_B568_8BD153322816"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And can you blame him? ⟪k:1⟫When he saw her, she was an absolute mess—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫hardly what "
"you would envision from a girl of class."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et peut-on lui en vouloir ? Quand il l’avait vu, elle ne ressemblait à rien —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ce "
"n’est pas ce qu’on pourrait imaginer d’une fille de haut rang."

#: scenario:scenario_64F00BBE_7B8D_46C5_B568_8BD153322817
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2fae5d5c68e6b3f792321eb4ea49d40d8d6360aec728c79c6f6fad2afe854fb
#. default-sha256: 5f6264df03ab45776b828340a5a373897b2f5a45acd85bae4aaf8f2802b7b7de
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_64F00BBE_7B8D_46C5_B568_8BD153322817"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But he did not seek her to find out whether that was true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais il ne voulait pas la voir pour vérifier son rang."

#: scenario:scenario_E23E4733_2ACA_4DDB_A0D9_7473C5EB1513
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12152933c6a4fb040726b61fa27917f7e4b394cad2baa17275b8a5f6acbad6fc
#. default-sha256: dfe7c5d22e70939d04b83d64eb784ee78fd3f586613a7953f650c23b32729d21
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E23E4733_2ACA_4DDB_A0D9_7473C5EB1513"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He merely wanted to see her once more, to ascertain whether what he had witnessed the "
"previous night was real or his imagination."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il voulait simplement la voir une fois de plus, pour s’assurer que ce dont il avait été "
"témoin la nuit précédente n’était pas le fruit de son imagination."

#: scenario:scenario_95D0836D_86AD_49F2_9127_9E559A901A1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5866ebe47238e508dc13f7fcbc3fa34e6fc71ef5137c4154ea6e1aaec4aee500
