msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(I don’t want to run into Mother...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That would be awkward.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(Je ne veux pas tomber sur Mère...⟪k:3⟫ Ce serait gênant.)"

#: scenario:scenario_BBFAA974_0BC1_4BA9_A8EC_342DBD38A263
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bdc54788b15046a49906492501d5eb3bf200a9582944427701723727e0865a4
