msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He was heading toward his mother’s bedchamber, but the closer he drew, the heavier "
"each step grew."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il se dirigea vers la chambre de sa mère mais plus il se rapprochait, plus son pas "
"devenait lourd."

#: scenario:scenario_45C9FFB4_BD1C_4EBC_BB0C_D79162CF8C1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9438906959d85ca720ae32a18fb9ee2cb2a50da863741efebae9a5a82a224e85
#. default-sha256: e167d39e02b801e9a816c1e7fa89a579010116db39ca7963a8110db8cbf2f03b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_45C9FFB4_BD1C_4EBC_BB0C_D79162CF8C1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He rounded a corner, debating whether or not to head back—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and stopped in his "
"tracks."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il prit un tournant en hésitant à rebrousser chemin—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫et s’arrêta net."

#: scenario:scenario_C4254A1C_E1C8_46C3_9D6D_12E2701B4CC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3267d04327430eae7296ac3954267c6737dd731c6ed132e26021625441c6e520
