#: scenario:scenario_B916317D_74AC_4EA2_8E2E_B2F35638D759
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58b44fca9f621f7ceb9c5b57cd0aec5ee5227d4a94e2066a7300351d3b52b866
