msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F4AA069C_9C81_4A60_BBB7_CD74309760F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The girl wore a pristine dress—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the uniform of the mansion’s abigails. ⟪k:4⟫"
"There was no longer any filth to obscure her beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La fille portait une robe immaculée—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ l’uniforme des soubrettes du manoir. "
"⟪k:4⟫Plus aucune saleté ne venait obscurcir sa beauté."

#: scenario:scenario_21F5A94F_8094_47C0_B9C7_13C9C3AAEDED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 895a22eb16e54f67fab338ba46dbd51e0d5cdc4cf90dee01cd58327c7a543ccf
#. default-sha256: 53370777dc36549596f7e34ccb536f21b908b8b4a95854f72af9138c783ae07b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_21F5A94F_8094_47C0_B9C7_13C9C3AAEDED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All that had covered her pure-white hair and glasslike skin was no longer. ⟪k:1⟫The one "
"thing that had not changed was her listless ruby eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tout ce qui avait recouvert ses cheveux d’un blanc pur ainsi que sa peau translucide n’était "
"plus. ⟪k:1⟫La seule chose qui restait identique était ses yeux rubis, comme indifférents."

#: scenario:scenario_6BAFAE6E_9CFA_4034_B9CA_09A43E98FE76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
